# File discipline (cloud)

Default: **edit the desk module that already owns the job.** Name the function you change.

Allowed: in-place edit · delete old + add replacement · merge files (delete extras).

Forbidden: new parallel Python files for one-off helpers. Omega stays hands-only — no TA/decision modules.

If you add a file, state the consolidate/delete. Master: `../QSWorkflow/MAP.md`.
